---
import { WHATSAPP_URL } from '../data/site';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section
  class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-700 via-brand-600 to-brand-500 py-18 sm:py-20"
  aria-labelledby="cta-heading"
>
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-20 right-0 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-white/10 blur-3xl"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-0 left-10 h-56 w-56 rounded-full bg-brand-400/30 blur-3xl"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6">
    <h2 id="cta-heading" class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
      是時候好好照顧你的牙齒了
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-100">
      無論是例行檢查，還是困擾已久的牙齒問題，都歡迎與我們聊聊。首次諮詢免費，沒有任何壓力。
    </p>
    <a
      href={WHATSAPP_URL}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-brand-700 shadow-lift transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-brand-50"
    >
      <Icon name="whatsapp" class="h-5 w-5" />
      立即 WhatsApp 預約
    </a>
    <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-brand-200">辦公時間內，我們通常於 30 分鐘內回覆</p>
  </div>
</section>
